<!--
  UX writing follows the three Hyundai Motor Group principles: 정확성(accuracy), 일관성(consistency),
  간결성(conciseness). Every coaching line names one concrete action, uses cluster terminology
  (핸들, 후진, 기어) and ends with 하세요 / 됩니다. No exclamation marks, no marketing adjectives.
-->
